<title>USA: Mass. Bay Auth. $160 mln notes won by five firms.</title>
<headline>Mass. Bay Auth. $160 mln notes won by five firms.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Five firms won portions of a $160 million Massachusetts Bay Transportation Authority note offering on Thursday.</p>
<p>There were 36 bids submitted for the offering.</p>
<p>First Albany Corp won $20 million and $32 million of notes; Lehman Brothers won $30 million of notes; Bear Stearns &amp; Co won $20 million of notes; PaineWebber Inc won $50 million of notes; and Prudential Securities won $8 million of notes.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
